          "author": null,
          "description": "- Updated `fetchConsentRefusedSeekerIds` to accept a list of seeker IDs for better flexibility.\n- Introduced `notificationResultSeekerIds` method to retrieve seeker IDs with current notifications.\n- Enhanced job alert logic to skip seekers who have refused consent, improving compliance with consent policies.\n- Improved logging for consent-related operations to aid in debugging and tracking.",
